# This folder holds locally staged media before upload to Supabase Storage.
# Subfolders mirror the Supabase storage buckets:
#   events/    → event-media bucket
#   projects/  → project-media bucket
#   blog/      → blog-media bucket
#   products/  → product-images bucket
#   members/   → member-media bucket (new)
#
# Files here are temporary. Once uploaded via the admin panel they
# are served from Supabase CDN and this folder can be cleared.
#
# Do NOT commit actual media files — this .gitkeep is the only
# tracked file in this directory.
